#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: sm-engineering.php
msgid "SM Engineering"
msgstr "SM Engineering"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-engineering.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-engineering.php
msgid ""
"Partner engineers and engineering missions. Engineers apply on their own "
"page and are approved by the platform; every study or inspection request "
"goes to the platform, which sends a quote to the client and gives the "
"mission to an approved engineer as a subcontractor. Clients never deal with "
"engineers directly. Requires SM Core."
msgstr ""
"Ingénieurs partenaires et missions d’ingénierie. Les ingénieurs postulent "
"sur leur propre page et sont validés par la plateforme ; chaque demande "
"d’étude ou d’inspection va à la plateforme, qui envoie un devis au client et"
" confie la mission à un ingénieur validé en sous-traitance. Les clients ne "
"traitent jamais directement avec les ingénieurs. Nécessite SM Core."

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-engineering.php
msgid "ReuSteel"
msgstr "ReuSteel"

